  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Three implementation styles",
      "items": [
        "Direct native wrappers: raknet, streamer, colandreas, cef, ompp and fcnpc turn samp.callNative into typed functions",
        "Hooking core classes: nex-ac, weapon-config, veh-para and distance use defineHooks or override __inject__ to rewrite entity behaviour",
        "Pure TypeScript: mapandreas reads heightmaps, rec reads bitfields, query speaks UDP, e-selection builds UI from TextDraws"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Extension points in core",
      "items": [
        "defineEvent declares an event; listeners form a middleware chain in registration order, advanced by next()",
        "defineHooks(Class) returns [original-method snapshot, setHook] to swap prototype methods for interceptors",
        "GameMode.use(script) only queues; loading happens in onInit, and IFilterScript.load() must return unsubscribe functions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Build and runtime boundary",
      "items": [
        "tsx scripts/build-all.ts runs serially: streamer, core, raknet, then the rest; each package type-checks before rolldown",
        "samp-node is loaded by open.mp, runs on Node 22 and injects the global samp object",
        "streamer and types are unpublished; shared has no package.json and is build-time only for five packages"
      ]
    }
  ]
